{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10124470","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10124470","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1012447001:1":{"text":"吓死我了……差点以为今天将成为我的忌日，我都想好葬礼上要让大家唱《熟睡的兔子一家》了。","source_cn":"吓死我了……差点以为今天将成为我的忌日，我都想好葬礼上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6C5B21F98B38987","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012447002:1":{"text":"莱卡，你记得吗？小时候你总唱这首歌给我听。","source_cn":"莱卡，你记得吗？小时候你总唱这首歌给我听。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0B24155FF818353","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012447003:1":{"text":"少说这些！你今天要是死了，我会让布莱恩把你的骨灰吹到世界边缘！","source_cn":"少说这些！你今天要是死了，我会让布莱恩把你的骨灰吹到世...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07844A8706F35C85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012447004:1":{"text":"你也太过分了……我只是开个玩笑。","source_cn":"你也太过分了……我只是开个玩笑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6473E49D11E6B202","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012447005:1":{"text":"我也觉得太过分了。","source_cn":"我也觉得太过分了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91F65D111B9DA500","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_titl